//Scroll+Elegy Faruzan is better than GT+Harp Faruzan by ~4k dps
//ToTM Furina is better than GT Furina by ~5k dps
//Noblesse beats Clam with c2 Xianyun. Clam is slightly higher simmed DPS for c0 Xianyun but can be inconsistent

